OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly cloudy at first with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of mainly light rain or
OL,7,Fdrizzle. Turning drier and brighter
OL,8,Fthrough the morning, then becoming
OL,9,Fwidely sunny by the afternoon. Feeling
OL,10,Fchilly though, especially near the
OL,11,Fcoast where winds are strongest.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry this evening but cold
OL,14,Fwith frost developing in places. Rain
OL,15,Fspreading northeastwards after
OL,16,Fmidnight, reaching all parts by
OL,17,Fmorning and falling as sleet or snow
OL,18,Facross the Peak District.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
