OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA cloudy, cold and wet day
OL,6,Fwith persistent, occasionally heavy
OL,7,Frain and some strong winds. Any risk
OL,8,Fof sleet or snow across the High Peaks
OL,9,Fshould diminish by early daytime.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FChangeable, with periods of rain on
OL,13,FWednesday. Eventually drier and
OL,14,Fbrighter on Thursday after early rain.
OL,15,FLargely dry Friday but a chance of
OL,16,Fshowers. Temperatures a little below
OL,17,Fnormal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
